Windows text editing 
- common shortcuts and patters


----------------

GENERAL WINDOWS:

select all - Ctrl + A
copy - Ctrl + C
paste - Ctrl + V
cut (delete and save to clipboard) - Ctrl + X
undo / redo - Ctrl + Z / Y

paste plain text - Ctrl + Shift + V

move word by word - Ctrl + Left / Right Arrow
start / end of line - Home / End
move paragraph by paragraph - Ctrl + Up / Down Arrow
start / end of document - Ctrl + Home / End

select word by word - Ctrl + Shift + Left / Right Arrow
select line - Shift + Up/Down Arrow
select from cursor to start / end of line - Shift + Home / End

delete backward (character or work  ) - Backspace / Ctrl + Backspace
delete forward (character or word) - Delete / Ctrl + Delete

------------------------

DAX:

New line - Shift + Enter
New line above - Ctrl + Shift + Enter
Jump to matching bracket - Ctrl + Shift + \
Start / End of code - Ctrl + Home / End

Comment / Uncomment - Ctrl + /
Move selected lines up / down - Alt + Up / Down Arrow
Duplicate line up / down - Shift + Alt + Up / Down Arrow
Delete selected lines - Ctrl + Shift + K

select all occurrences of word - Ctrl + Shift + L
select next occurrence of word - Ctrl + D
indent code - Tab or Ctrl + ]
outdent code - Shift + Tab or Ctrl + [

show suggestions - Ctrl + Space
show / hide tooltip - Ctrl + I

submit code - Ctrl + Enter / Enter
delete next word - Ctrl + Delete
select entire line - Ctrl + L

increase / decrease font size - Ctrl + + / -
close dax formula bar - Esc

expand / collapse formula bar - Ctrl + J 

expand selection left or right - Shift + Alt + Left / Right Arrow

---

Power Query M:

Increase / decrease font size - Ctrl + Shift + + / -
Reset font size - Ctrl + 0
Save and close editor - Ctrl + Tab, Enter
Functions tooltip - Ctrl + Shift + Space







Power Query UI:
First / Last column (selected entire column) - Home / End 
First / Last row (selected rows) - Alt + Home / End
Scroll page up / down (selected rows) - Page Up / Page Down
Select column - Ctrl + Space
Select all columns - Ctrl + A
Rename column - F2

Sort / Filter menu - Alt + Down Arrow
Data type menu - Ctrl + Arrow Down
Go to column - Ctrl + G






















